#include <stdio.h>

int main(void)
{
    printf("????\n");
}
```
Notice that four question marks are printed.
- Using a loop, we can more efficiently print the question marks:
```
// Prints a row of 4 question marks with a loop

#include <stdio.h>

int main(void)
