#include <cs50.h>
#include <stdio.h>

int main(void)
{
    int n;

[compare.c] - Using this new knowledge about how to assign values to variables, you can program your first conditional statement.
- In the terminal window, type code compare.c and write code as follows:
```
// Conditional, Boolean expression, relational operator

